  "body": "Located in the popular Ara Hills community, this brand-new single-level home offers modern comfort, quality finishes, and an easy-care lifestyle. Featuring 4 bedrooms and 3 bathrooms, it is an excellent choice for first-home buyers, families, or investors.\r\n\r\n• The stylish kitchen is the heart of the home, complete with quality appliances and plenty of storage.\r\n\r\n• The open-plan living and dining area flows seamlessly to a private deck, creating the perfect space for everyday living and entertaining.\r\n\r\n• Main master with a walk-in wardrobe and private ensuite.\r\n\r\n• Second master bedroom with its own ensuite, ideal for guests, extended family, or teenagers.\r\n\r\n• Two additional bedrooms serviced by a modern family bathroom.\r\n\r\n• Central air conditioning for year-round comfort.\r\n\r\nSituated just minutes from Redwood Park, Orewa Beach, local cafés, schools, shops, and motorway access, this home offers the perfect balance of convenience and relaxed coastal living.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
